## Instructions

### Overview

You are now taking part in a study of decision making. Please read these instructions carefully. Your earnings depend on your own decisions and on the decisions of other participants.

You will be randomly assigned to a group of **[[ n ]] participants**. [% if spec.matching == 'partner' %]You will stay in the **same group for all [[ spec.num_rounds ]] round[[ 's' if spec.num_rounds > 1 ]]**.[% else %]Groups are **randomly re-formed in every round**, so in each round you will usually be in a group with different participants.[% endif %] You will not learn who the other members of your group are, and they will not learn who you are.

### Your decision in each round

At the beginning of each round you receive **[[ e ]] points**. You decide how many of these points to put into a **group account**. You can contribute any whole number of points from 0 to [[ e ]]. The points you do not contribute stay in your **private account**.

### How your earnings are calculated

- Every point in your private account is worth one point to you.
- The points contributed by all members of your group are added up. [% if spec.threshold.enabled %]If this total is at least **[[ spec.threshold.amount ]] points**, then[% else %]Then[%endif %] every member receives **[[ spec.mpcr ]] points for every point in the group account**, no matter who contributed it.
[% if spec.threshold.enabled %]- If the total is **below [[ spec.threshold.amount ]] points**, the group account pays nothing.[% if spec.threshold.refund %] In that case every member gets their own contribution back.[% else %] In that case the contributions are lost.[% endif %]
[% if spec.threshold.bonus %]- If the total reaches [[ spec.threshold.amount ]] points, every member additionally receives a bonus of **[[ spec.threshold.bonus ]] points**.
[% endif %][% endif %]
In short, your earnings in a round[% if spec.punishment.enabled %] before deductions[% endif %] are:

**(points kept in your private account) + [[ spec.mpcr ]] × (total points in the group account)[% if spec.threshold.enabled %], if the total reaches [[ spec.threshold.amount ]][% endif %][% if spec.threshold.enabled and spec.threshold.bonus %], plus the bonus[% endif %]**

