### Deduction stage

After all members have decided, you see how many points each other member of your group contributed. Members are identified only by a number. You can then assign **deduction points** to each other member, from 0 to [[ spec.punishment.max_points ]] points per member.

- Each deduction point you assign **costs you [[ spec.punishment.cost_per_point ]] point[[ 's' if spec.punishment.cost_per_point > 1 ]]**.
- Each deduction point a member receives **reduces that member's earnings by [[ spec.punishment.impact_per_point ]] points**.
- You cannot spend more on deduction points than your earnings in that round.
[% if spec.punishment.floor_at_zero %]- Your earnings in a round cannot fall below zero.
[% endif %]
The other members can also assign deduction points to you.
[% endif %]
### After each round

At the end of each round you see the contributions of your group[% if spec.punishment.enabled %], the deduction points you received[% endif %] and your earnings.[% if spec.show_history %] A table shows your results from earlier rounds.[% endif %][% if spec.decision_timeout_seconds %] You have [[ spec.decision_timeout_seconds ]] seconds for each decision; if you do not decide in time, your contribution is recorded as 0.[% endif %]

### Payment

[% if spec.payment.rule == 'random_round' %]At the end of the study, **one round is selected at random**, and you are paid your earnings from that round. Every round is equally likely to be selected, so please treat every round as if it were the one that counts.[% else %]Your earnings from **all [[ spec.num_rounds ]] rounds are added up**.[% endif %] Points are converted into money at a rate of **[[ conv ]] points = 1 [[ spec.payment.currency_code ]]**. In addition, you receive a participation fee of **[[ fee ]] [[ spec.payment.currency_code ]]**.

### Before you start

You will answer [[ quiz | length ]] short question[[ 's' if quiz | length > 1 ]] to check that the rules are clear. If you have a question at any time, please raise your hand.
